Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Default to the ssh-remote-experiment server builds

Download servers from https://mmis1000.me/ssh-remote-experiment by default, and
when the client has no product commit and remote.SSH.devServerCommit is empty,
use the latest published build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
